From f30e2946628e385473cd66ab276a7f849d39ba55 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ms178 GLIBC audit <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 10:50:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] glibc: fix NSS, resolver, libio, spawn, loader and locale
 issues

Keep the audited v8 tuning and fix confirmed defects in previously under-audited
subsystems: preserve the NSS line terminator, make resolver configuration OOM
and realloc-safe, avoid NULL pointer subtraction in libio backup paths, grow
spawn actions geometrically with overflow checks, compare arbitrary-length
ld.so.cache numbers without signed overflow, bound localedef suffix scans, and
make tunables whitespace trimming linear.

Add focused NSS and spawn regression tests.
